Architecture: source all
Version: 7.4.15
Distribution: lmn74
Urgency: high
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-webui7 - Next generation web-based management tool for linuxmuster.net v7.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-webui7 (7.4.15) lmn74; urgency=high
 .
   * [security] [lmn_session] Root command execution when stopping an
     exam: the target directory is sanitized and the participants are
     checked in LDAP.
   * [security] [lmn_device-manager] Prestart commands: no path traversal,
     the rsync password is never returned, current school only.
   * [security] [lmn_clients] Only the custom scripts of the current
     school can be written.
   * [security] [lmn_common] Only global administrators can change the
     school.
   * [security] [lmn_permissions] The permissions matrix is restricted to
     root in dev mode.
   * [lmn_session] lmn_session_new is renamed lmn_session, the old upload
     methods are deprecated.
   * [lmn_permissions] Parent and staff permissions are handled.
   * The room of a user is read through linuxmuster-api.
